            "text": "<p>You can shop our wide array of products with just a click of a button! That is not just it! We are also opened 24/7 online, so you can shop from anywhere, at any time. We also have a loyalty point systems which can be converted into online credits, giving you great discounts of your next purchase or whenever you redeem them.</p>"
